rly night note → [2026-10-08_4.md](viking://resources/2026-10-08/2026-10-08_4.md)\\n\\n## Detailed Description\\n\\n### [2026-10-08_1.md](viking://resources/2026-10-08/2026-10-08_1.md)\\n\\nThis log collects iMessage records from October 8, 2026, spanning a direct thread with Maya and the Friday crew group with Me, Maya, and Leo. It documents tired at-home check-ins after a chaotic day and coordination for the next day, where Maya asks for 5pm instead because of something later that night, which Me accepts. The group thread contains similar tired after-work remarks. The content is structured with metadata such as arrived_at, channel, sender, source_id, participants, thread, and text, intended for personal coordination and record keeping.\\n\\n### [2026-10-08_2.md](viking://resources/2026-10-08/2026-10-08_2.md)\\n\\nThis log records the Friday crew group chat among Me, Maya, and Leo about Friday pizza planning. It uses timestamped entries with channel, sender, text, and chat metadata, including source identifiers for venue updates and attendance changes. Topics include Rosa's closure for renovations, a proposal for Domino's on Elm Street, a counter-proposal for Mario's on Pine Street with agreement on that venue, and Leo's notice that a closing shift prevents attendance on Friday. The key outcomes are the shift to Mario's on Pine Street and Leo's initial inability to attend.\\n\\n### [2026-10-08_3.md](viking://resources/2026-10-08/2026-10-08_3.md)\\n\\nThis archive captures the Friday crew conversation among Me, Maya, and Leo with detailed metadata including arrived_at, collected_at, channel, sender, from_owner, source_id, chat name, participants, text, thread, and written_at. It covers reactions to a last-minute change, confirmation that Me and Maya remain on with mention of Leo's share of knots, Leo rejoining for Friday after getting Tyler to cover a closing shift, and a recap noting Mario's on Pine Street as venue and a move to 5pm because of a commitment at parents. The result is Leo is back in for Mario's at 5pm pending confirmation.\\n\\n### [2026-10-08_4.md](viking://resources/2026-10-08/2026-10-08_4.md)\\n\\nThis short log preserves three timestamped records from the Friday crew thread with Me, Maya, and Leo on October 8, 2026. It focuses on confirming a 5pm Friday meeting time with reference to prior DMs, mentioning a craving for garlic knots, and noting tiredness with a plan to crash early. Agreement on 5pm Friday is shown by Me and Leo.\"}, {\"uri\": \"viking://resources/.abstract.md\", \"type\": \"resource\", \"score\": 0.775, \"abstract\": \"The resources directory is a collection point for structured conversation data focused on coordination and planning. It covers structured iMessage conversation logs gathered on October 7, 2026, with a central theme of coordinating pizza plans for Friday.\"}, {\"uri\": \"viking://resources/2026-10-08/2026-10-08_2.md\", \"type\": \"resource\", \"score\": 0.768, \"abstract\": \"This document logs an iMessage group chat among Me, Maya, and Leo in the Friday crew thread on 2026-10-08 about planning pizza on Friday. It contains timestamped message r...", "duration_ms": 67, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1791600609320}
